<section class="intro">
    <h1>About QTs &amp; Cuties</h1>
    <p>
        QTs &amp; Cuties is a comedy community in Denver, CO. Our events are open to everyone,
        but they are particularly geared towards folks who identify as queer, trans, and/or
        women — in the audience and on the mic.
    </p>
</section>

